' purpose: bounded OpenPGP clear-signature mathematics and exact Release index selection
' covers: tooling/native-ingress/release-signature.mjs
' covers: tooling/native-ingress/release-signature.test.mjs
' context: _spec/_plans/ml-runtime-redesign.md section 33 owns provenance qualification.
@startuml
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/proveo-ca/identity/main/proveo.puml
left to right direction
title Release signatures — mathematical validity is not publisher trust
actor "Caller-pinned full fingerprint\npublic key / clear-signed bytes" as CALLER <<host>>
component "verifyReleaseSignature\nv4 RSA / SHA256 or SHA512" as VERIFY <<app>>
component "Node crypto primitives\nRSA PKCS1 v1.5 verification" as CRYPTO <<host>>
component "Frozen signature evidence\nexact canonical text + hash" as EVIDENCE <<app>>
component "selectReleaseIndex\nexact repository/path expectation" as INDEX <<app>>
component "Frozen index descriptor\nlength / SHA256 / date claims" as DESCRIPTOR <<app>>
component "ReleaseSignatureError\nfixed code; no partial result" as ERROR <<error>>
CALLER ARROW_MAIN VERIFY : bounded private snapshots and exact fingerprint
VERIFY ARROW_MAIN CRYPTO : canonical text + hashed header + v4 trailer
CRYPTO ARROW_MAIN EVIDENCE : verify full preimage; prefix alone is insufficient
EVIDENCE ARROW_MAIN CALLER : signatureVerified:true under supplied key
CALLER ARROW_MAIN INDEX : the same verified canonical text
INDEX ARROW_MAIN DESCRIPTOR : unique exact SHA256 row and repository identity
DESCRIPTOR ARROW_MAIN CALLER : extractor signatureVerified:false
VERIFY ARROW_ERROR ERROR : malformed, unsupported or invalid signature
INDEX ARROW_ERROR ERROR : duplicate/missing/unsafe/ambiguous descriptor
ERROR ARROW_ERROR CALLER : fixed failure
note bottom of VERIFY
Release/keyring<=1MiB; signature<=16KiB
Packets<=256; signatures<=4; subpackets<=128
Primary RSA key only; no subkey adoption
No input views, reader, network or process
end note
note bottom of EVIDENCE
Publisher trust/key authentication remain false
No revocation, expiry or Native authority proof
Canonical text hash binds later selection
Issuer hints never select a different key
end note
note bottom of INDEX
Case-insensitive fields; reject duplicates
Origin='Ubuntu'; codename='resolute' only
Exact relative path, no fallback/normalization
Selected size1..16MiB; empty other rows allowed
Date claims do not establish trusted time
end note
@enduml
